    "tcp/443"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "solution": "Filter, Contract und Beziehungen in einem POST an `/api/mo/uni.json`:\n\n`{\"fvTenant\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"Portal\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvCtx\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"Prod\"}}}, {\"fvBD\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"BD-Web\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvRsCtx\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnFvCtxName\": \"Prod\"}}}, {\"fvSubnet\": {\"attributes\": {\"ip\": \"10.32.10.1/24\", \"scope\": \"private\"}}}]}}, {\"fvBD\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"BD-App\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvRsCtx\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnFvCtxName\": \"Prod\"}}}, {\"fvSubnet\": {\"attributes\": {\"ip\": \"10.32.20.1/24\", \"scope\": \"private\"}}}]}}, {\"fvBD\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"BD-Mon\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvRsCtx\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnFvCtxName\": \"Prod\"}}}, {\"fvSubnet\": {\"attributes\": {\"ip\": \"10.32.50.1/24\", \"scope\": \"private\"}}}]}}, {\"fvAp\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"Portal\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvAEPg\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"WEB\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvRsBd\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnFvBDName\": \"BD-Web\"}}}, {\"fvRsDomAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"uni/phys-PhysDom-Server\"}}}, {\"fvRsPathAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"topology/pod-1/paths-101/pathep-[eth1/1]\", \"encap\": \"vlan-110\", \"mode\": \"regular\"}}}, {\"fvRsCons\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnVzBrCPName\": \"web-to-app-https\"}}}]}}, {\"fvAEPg\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"APP\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvRsBd\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnFvBDName\": \"BD-App\"}}}, {\"fvRsDomAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"uni/phys-PhysDom-Server\"}}}, {\"fvRsPathAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"topology/pod-1/paths-102/pathep-[eth1/2]\", \"encap\": \"vlan-120\", \"mode\": \"regular\"}}}, {\"fvRsProv\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnVzBrCPName\": \"web-to-app-https\"}}}]}}, {\"fvAEPg\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"MON\"}, \"children\": [{\"fvRsBd\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnFvBDName\": \"BD-Mon\"}}}, {\"fvRsDomAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"uni/phys-PhysDom-Server\"}}}, {\"fvRsPathAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tDn\": \"topology/pod-1/paths-101/pathep-[eth1/6]\", \"encap\": \"vlan-150\", \"mode\": \"regular\"}}}]}}]}}, {\"vzFilter\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"https\"}, \"children\": [{\"vzEntry\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"tcp-443\", \"etherT\": \"ip\", \"prot\": \"tcp\", \"dFromPort\": \"443\", \"dToPort\": \"443\"}}}]}}, {\"vzBrCP\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"web-to-app-https\", \"scope\": \"context\"}, \"children\": [{\"vzSubj\": {\"attributes\": {\"name\": \"subj\", \"revFltPorts\": \"yes\"}, \"children\": [{\"vzRsSubjFiltAtt\": {\"attributes\": {\"tnVzFilterName\": \"https\"}}}]}}]}}]}}`\n\nWarum so: Der Consumer (WEB) startet die Verbindung zum Provider (APP). Mit *Reverse Filter Ports* erlaubt dasselbe Subject die Antwort von Quell-Port 443 zurück zu WEB. SSH, Ping und die Gegenrichtung bleiben im Implicit Deny. Ein Permit-any-Contract oder vzAny würde die Funktion erfüllen, aber mehr freigeben als verlangt.",
